    <sys:String x:Key="VideoThumbnail_Desc">Configure the external media tools used by Aniki Media Center for thumbnails and chapter-aware Up Next features.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="VideoThumbnail_Help">FFmpeg generates thumbnails around 10% into each video. FFprobe reads chapter names for Up Next and Skip Intro/Recap. Both features fall back automatically if a tool is unavailable.</sys:String>
